WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:34.500
Ah, I get it now.

3
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:36.790
You're gonna turn into
your Sulong form

4
00:01:36.790 --> 00:01:40.300
and go berserk once
you gaze at the moon.

5
00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:47.550
<b>I Can't Imagine Losing</b>

6
00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:54.800
It's Jack!

7
00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:03.520
You put together
a hell of a plan, didn't you?

8
00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:06.440
But that doesn't mean
you're strong enough to win.

9
00:02:06.440 --> 00:02:09.030
Just that we were careless.

10
00:02:09.030 --> 00:02:12.030
You won't lay another
finger on Kaido!

11
00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:14.950
I'm about to dye this snow
red with your blood!

12
00:02:18.240 --> 00:02:20.080
Hold your swords. One moment.

13
00:02:21.320 --> 00:02:23.750
Jack devastated our
thousand-year-old kingdom

14
00:02:23.750 --> 00:02:25.250
and tormented our people.

15
00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:27.340
That man is our sworn enemy.

16
00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:29.300
We turned him away
countless times,

17
00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:31.590
but he would not relent.

18
00:02:31.470 --> 00:02:34.270
The warrior you were
searching for is right here!

19
00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:36.520
It is I!

20
00:02:38.310 --> 00:02:40.110
I owe the Minks my life!

21
00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:42.400
Every cruelty you committed
shall be punished

22
00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:44.190
with the force of my fury!

23
00:02:58.400 --> 00:02:59.900
Please, allow us.

24
00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.320
Save your power for Kaido.

25
00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:04.150
You-gara as well.

26
00:03:18.460 --> 00:03:20.920
All right. Then best of luck.

27
00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.630
I'm grateful.

28
00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:25.510
I promise you-gara
that I will show Kaido

29
00:03:25.510 --> 00:03:27.890
every ounce of my strength.

30
00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.890
<b>Roddy & BB
Whale Forest Guardians</b>

31
00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:22.990
<b>Giovanni, Shishilian, & Concelot
Inuarashi's Three Musketeers</b>

32
00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:39.970
Don't worry, they can't
maintain that form for long.

33
00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:43.900
Yeah, bring it on!
We're beasts, too, you know!

34
00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:46.390
<b>Nangi of the Numbers</b>

35
00:05:09.410 --> 00:05:13.580
You think that rat bastard Jack
went outside with them, too?

36
00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.330
Unlike you, he's
considerate enough to leave.

37
00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:21.040
Huh? Excuse me?
What was that?

38
00:05:21.040 --> 00:05:26.460
If you've got a problem with me,
just say so, Punkass.

39
00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:56.810
No!

40
00:06:02.360 --> 00:06:04.690
Your plan was solid in theory.

41
00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:08.780
But the execution was
lacking, to say the least.

42
00:06:19.390 --> 00:06:21.680
Shinobu!

43
00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:26.770
Shinobu!

44
00:06:29.130 --> 00:06:33.220
Oh no!

45
00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:35.560
Shinobu!

46
00:06:35.560 --> 00:06:40.640
Lord Momonosuke!

47
00:06:40.640 --> 00:06:43.480
I passed out for
a moment. How shameful.

48
00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:45.610
Now, away!

49
00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.160
Wait, what?

50
00:06:58.040 --> 00:07:00.620
How the hell is he flying?

51
00:07:00.620 --> 00:07:01.960
And why is he so bad at it?

52
00:07:06.140 --> 00:07:12.570
I'm too high up! It's scary!

53
00:07:14.930 --> 00:07:16.930
He's floating through the air!

54
00:07:16.930 --> 00:07:22.690
What sorcery is this?

55
00:07:24.230 --> 00:07:28.280
On behalf of the
commander, I shall execute you!

56
00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:49.560
I can't see a damn thing!
How's he doing that?

57
00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:04.010
Just in time!

58
00:08:04.010 --> 00:08:10.850
It's Sanji! Let's go!

59
00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.930
Hand over the boy.

60
00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:13.970
He and the Kozuki name
must be erased from this world

61
00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:15.640
to retire from this
world once and for all.

62
00:08:15.640 --> 00:08:17.430
once and for all.

63
00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:37.050
Don't worry!
I've got you, my lord!

64
00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:46.560
Hey, Momo! Nice speech earlier!

65
00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:48.090
You were badass.

66
00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.640
I did my best!

67
00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:54.850
All right, Shinobu!
Keep him safe!

68
00:08:54.850 --> 00:08:56.560
Understood!

69
00:08:56.560 --> 00:08:59.400
Sangoro, I shall repay you!

70
00:09:04.860 --> 00:09:05.170
Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Hold up, my guy!

71
00:09:05.170 --> 00:09:06.420
I can't

72
00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:12.230
losing
end here! Knock it off!

73
00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.120
Damn it, you bird bastard!

74
00:09:18.120 --> 00:09:20.370
You're gonna leave
a gigantic hole in my torso

75
00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:22.420
if you keep this up!

76
00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.920
More than just that,
I'll rip you in two!

77
00:09:25.920 --> 00:09:29.590
If you're so scared,
why don't you disappear again?

78
00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:32.340
This might be hard for
your bird brain to comprehend,

79
00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:33.680
but it's just a trick.

80
00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:35.100
Lemme go, damn it!

81
00:09:35.100 --> 00:09:36.310
Say goodbye.

82
00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:53.000
That attack was crazy.
I think Sanji needs my help.

83
00:09:53.000 --> 00:09:55.460
Hey, Yomato! Be back in a sec!

84
00:09:55.460 --> 00:09:57.380
Keep an eye on Momo for me!

85
00:09:57.380 --> 00:09:58.760
Is that okay?

86
00:09:58.760 --> 00:10:00.890
Why wouldn't it be okay?

87
00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:03.510
Uh, right! You have a point!

88
00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.310
He... He is my son after all!

89
00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:09.900
Then hurry it up!

90
00:10:09.900 --> 00:10:11.650
Yeah. Leave it to me.

91
00:10:11.650 --> 00:10:12.860
That boy will be protected

92
00:10:12.860 --> 00:10:15.110
because that's what
good parents do!

93
00:10:15.110 --> 00:10:16.860
Hey! I'm not done with you!

94
00:10:16.860 --> 00:10:18.490
Wait for me, Momonosuke!

95
00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:19.740
Your father is on his way!

96
00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.620
Wait! Stop running away from me!

97
00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:26.660
Not so fast, you!

98
00:10:28.340 --> 00:10:31.050
Come on out and help Mama!

99
00:10:31.050 --> 00:10:33.260
The sooner we get
rid of these samurai,

100
00:10:33.260 --> 00:10:35.720
the sooner the feast can begin!

101
00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:38.140
You guys want that, don't you?

102
00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:44.570
It's time to pay!

103
00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:45.980
Remember the wedding?

104
00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:47.070
The tea party?

105
00:10:47.070 --> 00:10:48.990
And now this banquet!

106
00:10:48.990 --> 00:10:51.070
You've managed to
destroy everything

107
00:10:51.070 --> 00:10:52.820
I've looked forward to!

108
00:10:53.440 --> 00:10:59.190
I am going to destroy
you in a spectacular fashion!

109
00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:04.990
You will die
like the worm you are!

110
00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:10.250
Oh, no!

111
00:11:29.180 --> 00:11:34.020
What the hell was that?

112
00:11:40.320 --> 00:11:42.990
That crone is too powerful
for her own good.

113
00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.320
From the stories I've heard,

114
00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.320
she's not someone
we should take lightly.

115
00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:49.500
She's a pirate captain
every bit as fearsome as Kaido!

116
00:11:49.500 --> 00:11:52.370
Seriously? But if we
can't handle one guy,

117
00:11:52.370 --> 00:11:54.540
how are we supposed to
handle two of 'em, huh?

118
00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:58.460
I need to ditch her so I
can help Momo and Sanji!

119
00:11:58.460 --> 00:12:00.380
If I go to them, she'll follow,

120
00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:03.470
and the last thing I wanna do
is put them in more danger.

121
00:12:03.470 --> 00:12:06.680
Goodness, you're
rather slippery, aren't you?

122
00:12:06.680 --> 00:12:13.560
You scurried right out
of the way. Oh, Zeus?

123
00:12:13.560 --> 00:12:16.310
Hmm? Hm?

124
00:12:16.310 --> 00:12:19.150
Hey, Zeus! Where are you?

125
00:12:19.150 --> 00:12:20.900
Get back here!

126
00:12:20.900 --> 00:12:22.170
It's time to go!

127
00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.440
Uh, please, Nami,
what are you are doing?

128
00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:25.610
You've seen first-hand
how mad Mama can get!

129
00:12:25.610 --> 00:12:27.300
She's gonna murder us!

130
00:12:27.590 --> 00:12:29.420
I'll have to punish you.

131
00:12:31.260 --> 00:12:34.590
Now, let's get this
thing over with!

132
00:12:34.590 --> 00:12:37.340
Yes, Mama...

133
00:12:37.340 --> 00:12:40.220
Hey! You wanna
escape with your life

134
00:12:40.220 --> 00:12:42.180
or have Big Mom kill you?

135
00:12:42.180 --> 00:12:45.100
Huh? But I can't
go against Big Mom!

136
00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:48.480
That is enough!

137
00:12:53.570 --> 00:12:57.410
Nami!

138
00:12:57.410 --> 00:13:03.960
Give him back,
you little cat burglar!

139
00:13:04.460 --> 00:13:06.960
Please find it in your
heart to forgive me!

140
00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:10.840
It's all my fault.
I really messed up, Mama!

141
00:13:10.840 --> 00:13:14.390
I should have never
disobeyed you!

142
00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:19.140
Honey, it's all right.
Come back home.

143
00:13:19.140 --> 00:13:22.810
You can make it up to me
by taking out this little tramp!

144
00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:25.360
It's the only way
you can earn my trust!

145
00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:29.170
I will do anything
for you! Just say it!

146
00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:29.360
You want me to cut ties
with her? It's a done deal!

147
00:13:29.360 --> 00:13:30.900
You want me to
cut ties with her?

148
00:13:30.900 --> 00:13:32.260
It's a done deal!

149
00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:34.630
That's what I like to hear.

150
00:13:34.630 --> 00:13:34.860
Now go and make
your Mama proud.

151
00:13:34.860 --> 00:13:38.880
Now, go and make
your Mama proud!

152
00:13:38.880 --> 00:13:38.960
♪ Sakura! Dun-dun-dun! ♪

153
00:13:38.960 --> 00:13:39.810
♪ 
Sakura! Dun-dun-dun! ♪

154
00:13:39.810 --> 00:13:42.900
♪ Dun, dun, dun, dun! Yeah! ♪

155
00:13:41.830 --> 00:13:45.750
♪ The time? It's flown away. ♪

156
00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:47.710
♪ I'm like the wind. ♪

157
00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:49.460
♪ Dun, dun! ♪

158
00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:51.100
You've only got one chance
to make this right!

159
00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.260
You've only got one
chance to make this right!

160
00:13:54.260 --> 00:13:56.600
If you screw this up,
you're done for!

161
00:13:58.220 --> 00:13:59.760
No!

162
00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:06.160
Soul Sensor Activate!

163
00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:06.360
I am really sorry, Nami!
Been nice knowing you and all!

164
00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.320
I am really sorry, Nami!

165
00:14:09.320 --> 00:14:11.580
Been nice knowing you and all!

166
00:14:11.580 --> 00:14:16.110
You pathetic little coward!
I am so over you!

167
00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:22.120
Somebody help me!

168
00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:23.500
♪ My brother? ♪

169
00:14:23.500 --> 00:14:27.500
♪ I'm by his side,
like a bird we will fly. ♪

170
00:14:27.540 --> 00:14:33.420
– ♪ Saying goodbye, soaring so high, ♪
– ♪ Saying goodbye, soaring so high, ♪

171
00:14:33.420 --> 00:14:36.180
♪ you'll hear our cry! ♪

172
00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:40.350
♪ I'm a tough guy! ♪

173
00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:47.200
♪ Born to be free!
Go-go Franky! ♪

174
00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:04.330
Rain, rain go away.

175
00:15:13.550 --> 00:15:17.610
Whoops! I think
I hit something back there.

176
00:15:20.430 --> 00:15:20.530
No biggie. As long as
it wasn't a pretty flower.

177
00:15:20.530 --> 00:15:25.740
No biggie. As long as it
wasn't a pretty flower.

178
00:15:28.230 --> 00:15:31.480
Thanks, Big Bro!

179
00:15:34.090 --> 00:15:36.180
Mama! Wake up!

180
00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:36.550
This is about to get ugly,
real fast!

181
00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.220
They're doomed!

182
00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:44.100
She's gonna flip out!

183
00:15:44.100 --> 00:15:45.770
He hit her straight in the face!

184
00:15:51.730 --> 00:15:56.530
Big bro!

185
00:15:56.530 --> 00:15:58.650
Thank you! You're the best!

186
00:15:58.650 --> 00:16:02.030
Hey, are you-teia okay?
That was crazy!

187
00:16:02.030 --> 00:16:04.200
Yeah, it was crazy awesome!

188
00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:06.580
Franky's here!
We got this under control!

189
00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:10.330
Forward! Show 'em
what you've got!

190
00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:18.970
Guess we missed the kickoff.

191
00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.640
Oh, boy.

192
00:16:20.640 --> 00:16:24.390
That was quite the entrance
they made, but I have a plan.

193
00:16:24.390 --> 00:16:25.690
Can you help out?

194
00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:29.610
Of course! This should be fun.

195
00:16:29.610 --> 00:16:30.980
Wow, nice.

196
00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:33.570
It looks like they've
got things covered for now.

197
00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:35.860
All right, up I go.

198
00:16:35.860 --> 00:16:41.500
Time to help Kin'emon!
I'm ready!

199
00:16:43.380 --> 00:16:45.510
There you are!

200
00:16:47.430 --> 00:16:49.640
I'm so glad I found you!

201
00:16:49.640 --> 00:16:51.220
Kozuki Momonosuke!

202
00:16:54.140 --> 00:16:55.940
And who are you?

203
00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:02.690
Huh?

204
00:17:02.690 --> 00:17:04.360
Hey, Shinobu!

205
00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:07.740
Don't worry, he's our friend.

206
00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.360
He's gonna help you guys out.

207
00:17:09.360 --> 00:17:11.780
Huh? An ally?

208
00:17:14.740 --> 00:17:18.120
It's safer to be with
him than to be by yourselves.

209
00:17:20.210 --> 00:17:21.790
See ya!

210
00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:26.920
You're a friend of Sir Luffy?

211
00:17:26.920 --> 00:17:31.930
I am!

212
00:17:31.930 --> 00:17:34.720
Well, good. Then I'll trust you.

213
00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.270
What is your name?

214
00:17:40.190 --> 00:17:43.730
Glad you asked!

215
00:17:46.610 --> 00:17:51.740
My name is Kozuki Oden!

216
00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:56.870
And I shall protect you!

217
00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:59.290
You're my father?

218
00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:01.750
Lord Oden?

219
00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:11.050
Hold on.

220
00:18:11.050 --> 00:18:14.140
You have breasts. And horns!

221
00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:16.930
Why, you're not
my father at all!

222
00:18:16.930 --> 00:18:18.770
This is highly suspicious!

223
00:18:18.770 --> 00:18:20.310
You must be our foe!

224
00:18:20.310 --> 00:18:23.730
What?

225
00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:25.440
Smoke Escape Jutsu!

226
00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:29.190
Wait!
Why are you running away?

227
00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:43.170
There's too many of them.

228
00:18:43.170 --> 00:18:45.080
We just keep
getting bogged down.

229
00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:46.750
Yes, you're right.

230
00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.960
There's no point in
fighting these small fries.

231
00:18:48.960 --> 00:18:50.380
We need a change of plans.

232
00:18:50.380 --> 00:18:52.300
What about the Tobi Roppo?

233
00:18:52.300 --> 00:18:55.220
Those dinosaur people
that Denjiro mentioned?

234
00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:58.060
Might turn the tide if we
could kill some of them.

235
00:18:58.060 --> 00:19:00.890
Maybe that's a bit optimistic...

236
00:19:01.810 --> 00:19:05.360
But even if we can't win,
we can still stall them!

237
00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.040
Oh, you brutes!

238
00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:11.460
It takes some nerve
to run me over!

239
00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.540
Big Mom is about to go berserk!

240
00:19:28.790 --> 00:19:34.040
Look at all the
Straw Hats ling up.

241
00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.840
Are you ready to get crushed?

242
00:19:40.200 --> 00:19:44.280
Hello, Soul King!
It's been quite a while.

243
00:19:44.280 --> 00:19:47.080
If nothing else,
I applaud your captain

244
00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:50.290
for gathering so many
unique creatures.

245
00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:52.680
Yoho! I see you're
a woman of taste!

246
00:19:52.680 --> 00:19:56.480
Huh. Yeah? You like
my iron body, old hag?

247
00:19:56.480 --> 00:19:58.650
All right.

248
00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:04.530
Then I'll give you
a demonstration!

249
00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:09.410
Cyborg power! Can ya dig it?

250
00:20:12.830 --> 00:20:15.460
I'm one of a kind, baby!

251
00:20:15.460 --> 00:20:17.920
Franky, stop! Are you crazy?

252
00:20:17.920 --> 00:20:21.210
She's an Emperor! We gotta run!

253
00:20:21.210 --> 00:20:23.670
Is that so?

254
00:20:23.670 --> 00:20:27.880
Do we run from Emperors?

255
00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.560
I dunno.

256
00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:36.400
Guess we could,
but what about our captain?

257
00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:39.100
You want him to
become King of the Pirates.

258
00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:41.320
Don't you, Nami?

259
00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:59.540
...Radical Beam!

260
00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:00.630
Huh?

261
00:21:00.630 --> 00:21:02.880
Yikes! They're huge!

262
00:21:02.880 --> 00:21:08.760
What in the world are they?

263
00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.510
Hey, buzz off!

264
00:21:10.510 --> 00:21:14.640
If you're gonna go wild,
stay in your own banquet hall!

265
00:21:14.640 --> 00:21:17.230
Stupid Numbers!

266
00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:24.400
No!

267
00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:28.740
They're as big as Oars!
They're monsters!

268
00:21:29.780 --> 00:21:32.620
I'm getting mad flashbacks
from Thriller Bark.

269
00:21:35.950 --> 00:21:37.370
Fancy that!

270
00:21:37.370 --> 00:21:39.620
Those must be
Caesar's failed attempts

271
00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:41.840
at recreating ancient Giants.

272
00:21:41.840 --> 00:21:45.170
No use to me, but it would
seem that Kaido uses them!

273
00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:53.280
Is he grabbing
what I think he's grabbing?

274
00:21:53.280 --> 00:21:55.120
The Brachio Tank!

275
00:21:55.120 --> 00:21:57.270
Usopp and Chopper are in there!

276
00:21:57.270 --> 00:21:57.520
Hey, monster face!

277
00:21:57.520 --> 00:22:04.240
Put that down
or I'm gonna make you!

278
00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:08.160
Franky...

279
00:22:08.160 --> 00:22:12.700
...Radical...

280
00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:17.580
...Beam!

281
00:22:17.580 --> 00:22:20.210
Jaki!

282
00:22:30.260 --> 00:22:35.440
Now that my lasers are
upgraded, I'm unstoppable.

283
00:22:35.440 --> 00:22:42.110
Ah, you should've
saved that attack for me.

284
00:22:39.930 --> 00:22:46.930
It's too late now, iron man.

285
00:22:48.710 --> 00:22:50.130
Your hand, madam.

286
00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:53.110
Fish-Man Jiu-Jitsu!

287
00:22:53.110 --> 00:22:54.270
Huh?

288
00:22:56.570 --> 00:23:00.970
Mil Fleurs!

289
00:23:00.970 --> 00:23:06.560
Whirlpool Shoulder Throw!

290
00:23:10.730 --> 00:23:15.070
And Delphinium!

291
00:23:17.110 --> 00:23:20.530
I haven't forgotten
what you did to my fleet!

292
00:23:20.530 --> 00:23:23.040
I'll kill you, too, soon enough!

293
00:23:30.390 --> 00:23:32.770
Ha. Good luck.

294
00:23:36.170 --> 00:23:38.260
Nice plan!

295
00:23:41.240 --> 00:23:42.930
Went better
than expected!

296
00:23:42.930 --> 00:23:45.770
She'll be even angrier
when she gets back.

297
00:23:47.560 --> 00:23:50.530
You are quite a
remarkable woman.

298
00:23:50.530 --> 00:23:53.740
Good job! Thanks for the assist!

299
00:23:53.790 --> 00:23:55.660
I coulda been scrap metal!

300
00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:59.500
Then I'm
glad we made it in time!

301
00:23:59.500 --> 00:24:01.290
And now...

302
00:24:05.920 --> 00:24:08.840
The moment you've
all been waiting for.

303
00:24:18.060 --> 00:24:21.190
Commander Chopper!
Got a status report for me?

304
00:24:21.190 --> 00:24:24.570
Usopp! Wake up!

305
00:24:24.570 --> 00:24:26.530
Usopp! Pull it together!

306
00:24:26.530 --> 00:24:29.280
We're getting a call
from Franky! C'mon!

307
00:24:29.280 --> 00:24:30.740
Hey! What's gives?

308
00:24:30.740 --> 00:24:32.320
You good in there?

309
00:24:32.320 --> 00:24:39.160
Uh... Yep, couldn't fell better,
thanks to the Brachio Tank.

310
00:24:39.160 --> 00:24:43.170
You remember our promise, right?

311
00:24:43.170 --> 00:24:45.300
"Our promise"?

312
00:24:45.300 --> 00:24:47.460
We were gonna combine!

313
00:24:47.460 --> 00:24:50.260
The Iron Pirate, bro!

314
00:24:50.260 --> 00:24:52.340
Docking time, baby!

315
00:24:52.340 --> 00:24:53.800
Iron.

316
00:24:53.800 --> 00:24:56.140
...Pirate?

317
00:25:07.230 --> 00:25:09.310
Good. I can see the sky.

318
00:25:09.310 --> 00:25:13.900
Okay. I think I can
make it up from here.

319
00:25:13.900 --> 00:25:14.980
Not so fast!

320
00:25:16.150 --> 00:25:17.320
Uh, Master Queen!

321
00:25:17.320 --> 00:25:19.950
Go away, I'm taking a break.

322
00:25:19.950 --> 00:25:21.910
But it's Straw Hat!

323
00:25:21.910 --> 00:25:26.410
Huh? What?! He's here?!

324
00:25:26.410 --> 00:25:28.650
And who the hell is that?!

325
00:25:28.650 --> 00:25:30.240
Hey there, Zoro!

326
00:25:30.240 --> 00:25:30.330
Well, look who it is!
Where are you headed?

327
00:25:30.330 --> 00:25:33.200
Well, look who it is.
Where are you headed?

328
00:25:33.200 --> 00:25:35.780
Up to fight Kaido!

329
00:25:35.780 --> 00:25:37.460
I'm coming with you.

330
00:25:37.460 --> 00:25:41.510
You're not getting away!

331
00:25:47.310 --> 00:25:51.980
What the hell
is that thing? It's huge!

332
00:25:51.980 --> 00:25:53.060
Ready?

333
00:25:53.910 --> 00:25:59.500
Gum-Gum Rocket!

334
00:26:02.320 --> 00:26:03.820
Good! We got this.

335
00:26:03.820 --> 00:26:05.530
You said Kaido's up there?

336
00:26:05.530 --> 00:26:06.990
Yeah. I think he
started fighting

337
00:26:06.990 --> 00:26:09.290
with Kin'emon's group already!

338
00:26:09.290 --> 00:26:11.620
Just a little more!

339
00:26:19.410 --> 00:26:19.700
Damn!

340
00:26:19.700 --> 00:26:20.940
You ain't goin'
nowhere on my watch!

341
00:26:20.940 --> 00:26:21.180
You ain't goin'
nowhere on my watch.

342
00:26:21.180 --> 00:26:22.760
Damn!

343
00:26:26.940 --> 00:26:29.880
Give up. I control these skies!

344
00:26:32.780 --> 00:26:34.370
We're never gonna make it

345
00:26:34.370 --> 00:26:35.700
with these bastards hounding us!

346
00:26:35.700 --> 00:26:35.760
I didn't think they'd be
guarding the roof!

347
00:26:35.760 --> 00:26:38.180
I didn't think they'd
be guarding the roof!

348
00:27:01.560 --> 00:27:04.270
Yeah. That's what I'm
talkin' about!

349
00:27:04.270 --> 00:27:06.690
Let's do it!

350
00:27:07.440 --> 00:27:09.860
– Docking formation!
– Docking formation!

351
00:27:09.860 --> 00:27:12.360
Ready to combine!

352
00:27:19.460 --> 00:27:23.290
Black Rhino, standing by!

353
00:27:23.290 --> 00:27:25.420
– Brachio Head, activate!
– Brachio Head, activate!

354
00:27:25.420 --> 00:27:26.500
Let's do this!

355
00:27:28.920 --> 00:27:31.880
Sorry, bros,
it's only got one seat!

356
00:27:31.880 --> 00:27:33.550
What?!

357
00:27:33.550 --> 00:27:36.010
This is a betrayal!

358
00:27:36.010 --> 00:27:37.260
Who's that up there?

359
00:27:37.260 --> 00:27:40.020
It's Usohachi!
And Choppereamon!

360
00:27:40.020 --> 00:27:41.680
Are you two all right?

361
00:27:41.680 --> 00:27:42.940
Back at the Pleasure Hall,

362
00:27:42.940 --> 00:27:45.230
you guys really stuck
your necks out for us!

363
00:27:45.230 --> 00:27:46.940
We really owe you one!

364
00:27:46.940 --> 00:27:49.780
Yeah, sure! But you can
thank us later!

365
00:27:49.780 --> 00:27:51.070
Yeah, later!

366
00:27:51.070 --> 00:27:54.160
Right now, there's a robot
that you gotta see!

367
00:28:21.300 --> 00:28:24.240
Let's rock!

368
00:28:27.220 --> 00:28:29.470
Then why do you have
a giant robot?

369
00:28:38.560 --> 00:28:40.230
He took out Jaki fast!

370
00:28:40.230 --> 00:28:42.190
That thing is bad news!

371
00:28:42.190 --> 00:28:44.280
Let's move!
We'll just get stomped!

372
00:28:44.280 --> 00:28:46.280
Uh, yeah!

373
00:28:51.410 --> 00:28:53.790
Momo...

374
00:28:53.790 --> 00:28:55.580
I hope he got away.

375
00:29:00.650 --> 00:29:02.940
Oh, sorry.

376
00:29:02.940 --> 00:29:05.200
This just tickles my funny bone.

377
00:29:05.200 --> 00:29:06.740
Look around us!

378
00:29:06.740 --> 00:29:07.060
We're outnumbered,
enemies on every side.

379
00:29:07.060 --> 00:29:10.490
We're outnumbered.
Enemies on every side.

380
00:29:10.490 --> 00:29:10.820
And yet, for some reason,
I feel like we can't be beat.

381
00:29:10.820 --> 00:29:15.160
And yet for some reason,
I feel like we can't be beat.

382
00:29:15.160 --> 00:29:15.360
You're damn right!

383
00:29:15.360 --> 00:29:16.420
You're damn right.

384
00:29:16.420 --> 00:29:18.040
I thought the same thing.

385
00:29:18.040 --> 00:29:18.370
I wonder why?

386
00:29:18.370 --> 00:29:19.170
I wonder why. Where does
this courage come from?

387
00:29:19.170 --> 00:29:21.340
Where does this
courage come from?

388
00:29:21.340 --> 00:29:21.540
When you put it that way

389
00:29:21.540 --> 00:29:23.210
When you put it that way,

390
00:29:23.210 --> 00:29:27.750
I suppose we have Mister
Straw Hat to thank, don't we?

391
00:29:29.760 --> 00:29:32.850
Looks like I won't be able
to jump up there after all.

392
00:29:32.850 --> 00:29:35.480
I guess, I need a new plan.

393
00:29:35.480 --> 00:29:37.940
I've got your back, Captain.

394
00:29:37.940 --> 00:29:42.730
You've got me. Let's head up.

395
00:29:42.730 --> 00:29:44.940
This is a damn pain.

396
00:29:44.940 --> 00:29:46.200
Bastards were ready.

397
00:29:46.200 --> 00:29:48.200
They got the whole
swarm up there!

398
00:29:48.200 --> 00:29:50.030
They'll be nothing
but caterpillars

399
00:29:50.030 --> 00:29:51.780
once we tear off their wings.

400
00:29:51.780 --> 00:29:53.540
I get the sentiment,
but do you have to be

401
00:29:53.540 --> 00:29:55.040
so creepy about it?

402
00:29:57.080 --> 00:29:58.460
I suppose those dinosaurs

403
00:29:58.460 --> 00:30:01.170
are the fabled
"Lead Performers"?

404
00:30:04.630 --> 00:30:06.260
They look pretty tough,

405
00:30:06.260 --> 00:30:09.010
but I'm not worried
'cuz our captain's stronger!

406
00:30:09.010 --> 00:30:10.260
That's right.

407
00:30:10.260 --> 00:30:12.850
And as navigator,
it's my duty to help him

408
00:30:12.850 --> 00:30:15.220
get wherever he needs to go!

409
00:30:18.560 --> 00:30:20.270
Don't sweat a thing, brother.

410
00:30:20.270 --> 00:30:22.400
General Franky's gonna
clear out those thugs

411
00:30:22.400 --> 00:30:24.900
before you can say "super"!

412
00:30:26.380 --> 00:30:29.160
Everyone's ready, Captain!

413
00:30:30.800 --> 00:30:33.090
Right! Time for round two!

414
00:30:33.090 --> 00:30:34.760
Let's do it!

415
00:30:34.760 --> 00:30:37.890
Samurai! Don't give 'em an inch!

416
00:30:37.890 --> 00:30:40.290
We're counting on you!

417
00:30:54.700 --> 00:30:55.180
You better get ready, Kaido,
'cause I'm coming for you.

418
00:30:55.180 --> 00:30:58.100
You better get ready, Kaido.

419
00:30:58.100 --> 00:31:00.810
'Cause I'm coming for ya.
